{
  "info": {
    "name": "Foodify — Sprint 2 Marketplace & Payments",
    "description": "Manual collection. Login using the existing account collection, set access_token, then read IDs, cart revision and total from API responses. One cart/order per merchant. Do not put provider secrets here. Paymob callbacks must come from Paymob with a real HMAC; no fake success callback is supplied.",
